{"title":"Black Walnut Quiver","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Bowyer Lv 33)</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Bowyer at level 33 <span class=\"muted\">(1630 XP)</span> from 5× <a href=\"#/item/black-walnut-wood\">Black Walnut Wood</a>, 6× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/bowyer\">Bowyer</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Other materials</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/pine-quiver\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/8b428e61076ac4262e72.svg\" alt=\"\">Pine Quiver</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/oak-quiver\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/58fb242c46d0f616b998.svg\" alt=\"\">Oak Quiver</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/shagbark-quiver\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/2471bd55b1e608c22ad0.svg\" alt=\"\">Shagbark Quiver</a></p><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/black-walnut-wood\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/300340adb40289ce0164.svg\" alt=\"\">Black Walnut Wood</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/wool\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/5591944d6121d6a586be.svg\" alt=\"\">Wool</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/6086a2f4a06ffa3f56be.svg\" alt=\"Black Walnut Quiver\"></div><h3>Black Walnut Quiver</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Bowyer 33</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </table></aside></article>"}